## Usage Instructions

### Adding a New Team Member
Create `src/content/team/new-person.md`:
```markdown
---
name: "New Person"
role: "Research Assistant"
email: "new@university.edu"
order: 7
---

Brief bio about the person.
```

### Adding a Publication
Create `src/content/publications/my-paper-2024.md`:
```markdown
---
title: "My Amazing Paper"
authors: ["Author One", "Author Two"]
venue: "Conference Name 2024"
year: 2024
date: 2024-10-15
pdf: "https://example.com/paper.pdf"
code: "https://github.com/username/repo"
---

Optional abstract or description.
```

### Running Locally
```bash
npm run dev
```

Visit `http://localhost:4321`

### Building for Production
```bash
npm run build
```

