## Key Benefits
✅ All content in simple Markdown files  
✅ Type-safe content schemas  
✅ Automatic sorting and organization  
✅ Easy to add/edit team members, publications, research areas  
✅ No database needed  
✅ Fast static site generation  
✅ Automatic deployment to GitHub Pages